[
  {"note": "Intersection Curve takes curves of other sketches (#11048). A line on XY stands in for the plane y = 0 and a line on YZ at z = 5 for the plane z = 5, so the result is one linked 3D wire along X at y = 0, z = 5. After the first pick the status bar asks for the second; a right-click starts the picks over; after the curve is made the hint asks for the next pair."},
  {"start": "sketch.create"},
  {"click": {"plane": "XY"}},
  {"start": "sketch.line"},
